PRACTICAL: DOCKER COMPOSE FOR A WEB-BASED AI APP
SIMPLE CODE VERSION

TITLE:
Use Docker Compose to manage three containers:
1. Frontend
2. AI Model
3. Database

============================================================
1. AIM
============================================================
To create and run a simple web-based AI application using Docker Compose. The frontend accepts input, the AI model predicts an output, and the database stores the prediction.

