16. VIVA QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS
============================================================
Q1. What is Docker Compose?
Ans. It is a tool used to manage multiple Docker containers using one YAML file.

Q2. What is compose.yaml?
Ans. It is the configuration file that defines the application services.

Q3. How many containers are used in this practical?
Ans. Three containers: frontend, AI model, and database.

Q4. What is the purpose of the frontend?
Ans. It accepts input from the user and displays the prediction.

Q5. What is the purpose of the AI model?
Ans. It predicts the house price based on the given area.

Q6. What is PostgreSQL?
Ans. PostgreSQL is a relational database management system.

Q7. What is a Docker volume?
Ans. It stores data even when a container is removed.

Q8. What does docker compose up do?
Ans. It creates and starts all services.

Q9. What does docker compose down do?
Ans. It stops and removes the containers and network for the Compose project.

Q10. What is port mapping?
Ans. It connects a port on the computer to a port inside a container.
